		(uuid 060b3c6e-bf37-4692-8dd8-9486f44a6f9c)
	)
	(text "Changelog:\nRevA: \n- Changed MCU to STM32G473RET6\n- Changed most SOM connector pins slightly\n	- Replaced redunant GND/GNDA pins with more data pins\n	- Added extra functionality to some pins\n	- Added extra SPI, I2C, UART\n	- Removed I2C pullups\n- Change pp values to be 24V\n- Swap out power stuff to match PSOM\n	- 24v - 5v buck\n	- 5v power mux\n	- overvoltage/current values\n	- 5v - 3v LDO\n	- Connect IMON to MCU\n	- Recalculated math\n- Changed a couple circuits to look better\n- Replaced seven segment with addressable leds (easier, less space)\n- Updated ICs to KiCad-Sharepoint from UTSVIT-Kicadlibaries\n- Fixed/added symbols and footprints for several components\n- Removed extra general purpose button\n- Bootloader switch and OR gate\n\nRevB: \n- Added pullup to reset switch\n- Fixed Reset Buttom footprint\n- Added 5v usb and buck leds\n- Replaced RPP current monitoring with debug led\n- Some schematic and layout adjustments to make things better\n\nRevB.1:\n- Fixed bootloader USART3 pins from PB10/11 to PC10/11\n- removed IMON in schematic\n- Validated identification box\n- AddressableLED testpoint\n- Boot switch silkscreen\n\nRevC:\n- Switched to stm32 usb peripheral \n- modified several pins: uarts, spi, usb, and some adcs. \n	- moved spi3 to pc10-pc12\n	- removed uart4 and uart5 for usart1\n	- removed fdcan1, added fdcan2, moved fdcan2 and fdcan3\n	- moved a lot of the onboard gpio stuff like addressable or sd det\n\nin progress:\n- Changed board stackup to sig+power/gnd/gnd/sig+pwr\n- Moved USB connector and SD card to better position\n- Rerouted power distribution "
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 299.72 10.922 0)
